SUMMARY:Jeff's Short Gentle Mimico Ride
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Bike Meetup\nHi everyone. How about a short gentle rid
 e? Meet at 10:30 AM sharp at Coronation Park on the south side of Lake Sho
 re Blvd W right at the foot of Strachan Ave. We will bike west along the w
 aterfront Martin Goodman trail\, across the Humber Bridge\, out to Mimico 
 (at Norris Crescent)\, and then return to our starting point. Total distan
 ce about 18 km. Gentle pace of about 15 kph\, with a few brief stops. All 
 on the paved trail\, so should be fine for any bicycle type. If it's raini
 ng I will CANCEL\, so please check before heading out. Thanks\, I hope to 
 see you there!
